  "name": "Local",
  "summary": "Open the MySQL database of a Local WordPress site in TablePro from the site's Database tab.",
  "description": "A Local add-on that adds an Open TablePro button to a running site's Database tab. TablePro connection URLs cannot point at a MySQL socket, so the add-on opens a short-lived TCP bridge on 127.0.0.1 to the site's socket and hands TablePro a connection URL for it.\n\nInstall it in Local from Add-ons, Installed, Install from Disk, using the .tgz from the latest release. It needs Local 10 or later.",
